<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the</p>
<p>following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek</p>
<p>mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices.</p>
<p>					Feb 17/Feb 14    Feb 17/Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.19		 2.56</p>
<p>  Fixed income mutual funds	   0.11		 1.75</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.43		 4.55</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			    2.11		24.95</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.91		19.38</p>
<p>  Fixed income mutual funds	   0.94		20.38</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.12		 2.36</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.31		 0.51</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			    1.09		20.92</p>
<p>  Fixed income mutual funds	   1.05		21.24</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.56		 3.84</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    2.41		22.47</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual</p>
<p>funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31,</p>
<p>1991.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
